+            // lands in the page raster BEFORE this pass samples its backdrop,
+            // which is the entire fix. D's contract is untouched: the glass
+            // still samples pre-weave page pixels and still stays crisp; the
+            // depth behind it still reads flat. Flat is merely now the tile's
+            // own flat content rather than nothing.
+            //
+            // Only when the tile's canvas is actually SUPPRESSED. An
+            // unsuppressed tile still has its own quad in the page raster —
+            // the page is already its own recovery, and a better one.
+            if (tile.canvas_resource_id != kInvalidResourceId &&
+                !inline_3d_suppressed_resources_.empty() &&
+                inline_3d_suppressed_resources_.contains(
