+  // ---- (browser#120) MONO UNDER FROST -------------------------------------
+  //
+  // This quad is an inline-3D tile's canvas, SUPPRESSED from the page raster,
+  // with one or more frosted rects over it. DirectRenderer::ShouldSkipQuad let
+  // it through for exactly this: draw its LEFT-EYE HALF, clipped to those
+  // rects and to nothing else, so the backdrop-filter pass that comes later in
+  // this same back-to-front walk blurs real flat content instead of a void.
+  //
+  // Drawn HERE, in the quad's own place in the page raster, is the whole point
